{comment: Verse 1}
In the [Am]tiny town where I [C]come from
You [G]grew up doing what your [D]daddy's done
And you [Am]don't ask questions, you [C]do it just be[G]cause
You don't [Am]climb too high or [C]dream too much
With a [G]whole lot of work and a [D]little bit of luck
You can [Am]wind up right back [C]where your daddy [G]was

{comment: Chorus}
