We all stick a[G]round 'cause they all tell us [D]to [B]
You swallow your [Em]pride just to make your family [G]proud
If I didn't [D]think that it would shut the whole place [C]down
I'd [C]ride my pony right [D]out of this one horse [Em]town
Yeah, this one horse [G]town

